DESCRIPTION:Happy hour at Upland's Bloomington brewpub\, Monday to Friday f
 rom 3 to 5 PM.\n\n$4 core beers: Dragonfly IPA\, Champagne Velvet\, Wheat A
 le and Campside.\n\nFood:\n- Chicharrones with smoked chili seasoning\, Bad
  Elmer's BBQ and lime ($5)\n- Sliders\, $4 each. Burgers: Classic\, Bad Elm
 er's Fav\, Blue Flame\, Inferno\, Beer Cheese or Sweet Plum. Sandwiches: Lo
 cal Pulled Pork\, Hoosier Tenderloin\, Turkey & Guac.\n- Mini brownie with 
 whipped cream\, mint and Bad Elmer's caramel ($4)\n\nDaily beer specials ($
 5 pints\, $15 pitchers): Monday Dragonfly IPA\, Tuesday Champagne Velvet an
 d CV Light\, Wednesday Wheat Ale\, Thursday Campside Pale Ale\, Friday rota
 ting draft. Saturday is 20% off barrel-aged sour drafts\, and Sunday brings
  back the Monday to Thursday specials.\n\nTo go: crowlers of any core or sp
 ecialty beer are $10\, or 3 for $25\, every day. Growlers are $2 off the Mo
 nday to Thursday specials on Wednesday and Sunday.\n\nSpecials from Upland'
 s in-house menu as of October 2026 and may change. Check with Upland for cu
 rrent offerings.\n\nListed by BloomingtonOnline.com\, your community direct
 ory and local news hub for Bloomington and Monroe County.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261022T212653Z
LOCATION:Upland Brewing Co. Brewpub\, 350 W 11th St\, Bloomington\, IN 4740
 4
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Happy Hour at Upland Brewing Co.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
