CREATED:20241228T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join The Hub as we kick off FreezeFest with a chili cook-off fe
 aturing chefs from our local community! Sample a variety of chilis\, vote f
 or the People's Choice Award\, and see which dishes win the judges' picks f
 or Best Overall\, Best Vegetarian\, and Most Creative Chili.\n\nEnjoy the u
 nique Hoosier pairing of chili and cinnamon rolls (provided by Two Sticks B
 akery) and cool down your palate with ice cream from Chocolate Moose.\n\n📍
  Location: The Mill\, 642 N. Madison Street\, Bloomington\, IN\n🎟️ Price: 
 $20\n📅 Date: Thursday\, January 23\, 2025\n⏰ Time: 5:00 PM - 7:00 PM\n\nFo
 r more information or questions\, contact outreach@mhcfoodpantry.org or cal
 l (812) 339-5887.
LAST-MODIFIED:20241228T211019Z
LOCATION:The Mill\, 642 N Madison St\, Bloomington\, IN 47404\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:2025 Chilly Cook-Off
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
