DESCRIPTION:National Wing Day (July 29) at BuffaLouie's in Bloomington. As 
 part of the "Eat Wings. Give Back." campaign\, BuffaLouie's will donate $1 
 for every bone-in wing sold to Riley Children's Foundation\, supporting fam
 ilies served by Riley Hospital for Children. Same fundraiser also runs at t
 he Carmel location.<br><br>Source: Herald-Times/Evening World\, "Taking Buf
 faLouie's to the next level\, and helping others along the way\," July 28\,
  2026.<br>More info: <a href="https://buffalouies.com/" target="_blank">buf
 falouies.com</a>
