DESCRIPTION:The Bethel Lane Farm Stop food truck is open on weekends. Stop 
 by for hot coffee\, cold brew with flavored syrups\, hot tea\, chai tea lat
 tes\, hot apple cider\, and apple cider slushies. Also on the menu: fresh\,
  locally grown salads from Morning Harvest Produce\, Mkono Charcuterie Boxe
 s\, Tell City Soft Pretzels\, Bright Side Cafe gluten-free treats\, and mor
 e. Open Fridays\, Saturdays\, and Sundays to start. Hours may change\, so c
 heck with the farm stop.
