DESCRIPTION:<div>Now taking pre-orders for platters for your special event.
  We offer wrap platters\, fruit platters\, and veggie platters. Platters ca
 n begin for pick up on December <a></a>19th\, 2022.<div><br><span>If intere
 sted please contact our Director of Operations: Faye Pfenninger at <a href=
 "mailto:faye@bowls4boots.com" target="_blank">faye@bowls4boots.com</a> or b
 y phone at 812-287-8392.</span><br><br><b>We officially open on Dec 19th</b
 >. We will be doing a soft opening next week Monday\,  Tuesday\, Friday\, a
 nd Saturday 7am-2pm. So excited to share this journey with this great commu
 nity. We are looking forward to giving back to other veterans and first res
 ponders at the end of our first quarter.<br><br><b>Menu:</b> cereal\, yogur
 t\, oatmeal\, topping bar. Oatmeal is 7a-11am.<br>Lunch we have wraps. <br>
 <br>Soup is coming in January. Cereal and yogurt is all day.</div></div>
