UID:kmtg52vbmj973nk5c6k7648q5q@google.com
CREATED:20240708T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us August 1-31 for an entire month of NEW vegan options al
 l over Bloomington! During this time\, restaurants throughout the Bloomingt
 on area will feature special vegan menu items. Diners have the opportunity 
 to visit restaurants\, enjoy meals\, vote\, comment\, and post photos of th
 e delicious vegan meals they have ordered. This month-long event brings all
  diners—not just vegans.<br><br><h3>About Vegan Outreach</h3><p>Vegan Outre
 ach is a 501c3 nonprofit dedicated to ending violence toward animals and en
 visions a future free from animal exploitation. Established in 1993\, the o
 rganization initially gained recognition for its extensive college campus l
 eafleting program\, distributing over a million booklets per semester.</p><
 p>Currently\, Vegan Outreach focuses on their "10 Weeks to Vegan" program\,
  a global initiative helping individuals transition to a vegan lifestyle. S
 ince 2019\, over 1.5 million people from 59 countries have participated. Th
 e program includes 63 tailored series and offers support through 49 Faceboo
 k groups and nutrition advice from registered dietitians.</p><p>Vegan Outre
 ach also organizes Vegan Chef Challenges\, month-long events that feature n
 ew vegan menu items at local non-vegan restaurants. These challenges genera
 te positive media attention and encourage restaurants to retain popular veg
 an dishes. In 2023\, 30 cities hosted Vegan Chef Challenges\, contributing 
 to the organization's mission to promote veganism and create lasting change
  for animals.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240708T195958Z
LOCATION:Bloomington\, IN\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bloomington Vegan Month Celebration
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
