DESCRIPTION:<div>Now taking pre-orders for platters for your special event.
  We offer wrap platters\, fruit platters\, and veggie platters. Platters ca
 n begin for pick up on December <a></a>19th\, 2022.<div><br /><span>If inte
 rested please contact our Director of Operations: Faye Pfenninger at <a hre
 f="mailto:faye@bowls4boots.com" target="_blank">faye@bowls4boots.com</a> or
  by phone at 812-287-8392.</span><br /><br /><b>We officially open on Dec 1
 9th</b>. We will be doing a soft opening next week Monday\,  Tuesday\, Frid
 ay\, and Saturday 7am-2pm. So excited to share this journey with this great
  community. We are looking forward to giving back to other veterans and fir
 st responders at the end of our first quarter.<br /><br /><b>Menu:</b> cere
 al\, yogurt\, oatmeal\, topping bar. Oatmeal is 7a-11am.<br />Lunch we have
  wraps. <br /><br />Soup is coming in January. Cereal and yogurt is all day
 .</div></div>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221211T183308Z
