CREATED:20221211T183144Z
DESCRIPTION:<div dir="auto">Now taking pre-orders for platters for your spe
 cial event. We offer wrap platters\, fruit platters\, and veggie platters. 
 Platters can begin for pick up on December <a></a>19th\, 2022.<div dir="aut
 o"><br><span style="background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\; color: var
 (--on-surface)\;">If interested please contact our Director of Operations: 
 Faye Pfenninger at faye@bowls4boots.com or by phone at 812-287-8392.</span>
 <br><br><b>We officially open on Dec 19th</b>. We will be doing a soft open
 ing next week Monday\, &nbsp\;Tuesday\, Friday\, and Saturday 7am-2pm. So e
 xcited to share this journey with this great community. We are looking forw
 ard to giving back to other veterans and first responders at the end of our
  first quarter.<br><br><b>Menu:</b> cereal\, yogurt\, oatmeal\, topping bar
 . Oatmeal is 7a-11am.<br>Lunch we have wraps.&nbsp\;<br><br>Soup is coming 
 in January. Cereal and yogurt is all day.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221211T183237Z
LOCATION:Fountain Square\, 101 W Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, IN 47404\, US
 A
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bowls 4 Boots - Soft Opening
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
