DESCRIPTION:\nTaste of Bloomington is back and here is what you need to kno
 w:\n\n• Free to attend—no ticket needed.\n• Taking place in downtown Bloomi
 ngton on Kirkwood Ave. (Walnut St. to Indiana Ave.)\n• $5 cap on food so yo
 u can try lots of different things.\n• Music headliners Clayton Anderson & 
 Dizgo\, with more bands TBA.\n• Featuring local restaurants\, food trucks\,
  breweries\, wineries\, and distilleries.\nBig thanks to Master Rental for 
 making it all happen and Mark Bookwalter for the logo design.\nFor vendor\,
  sponsorship\, or volunteer info\, email tastebtown@gmail.com.\nFor more de
 tails\, check out our facebook page and website!\n\nhttps://www.facebook.co
 m/events/2533547466976666/
